+ * and kept (4.6 KB each, about a hundred people): its frames are the sprite's
+ * images, its palette an ext palette of tag NPC_LOOK_PAL_TAG + graphics id,
+ * loaded while someone shows it. The ext palettes are shared with the
+ * follower, its ball and the visible wild Pokemon (follower_mon.c), so the
+ * people take NPC_LOOK_PALETTES of them at most; one more on screen than that
+ * is drawn as the game draws it, until a palette is free again.
